{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004580","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004580"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004580","label":"紂引古（樂毅列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"紂","mention_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0022","c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0075","c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0109"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","quote":"紂"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0075","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","quote":"紂"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0109","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","quote":"紂"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004580","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004580","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004580","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji080-026","person_id":"cbr-p004580","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["紂"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","quote":"燕王恨不用樂閒，樂閒既在趙，乃遺樂閒書曰：「紂之時，箕子不用，犯諫不怠，以冀其聽；商容不達，身祇辱焉，以冀其變。及民志不入，獄囚自出，然後二子退隱。故紂負桀暴之累，二子不失忠聖之名。何者？其憂患之盡矣。今寡人雖愚，不若紂之暴也；燕民雖亂，不若殷民之甚也。室有語，不相盡，以告鄰里。二者，寡人不為君取也。」"}],"rationale":"樂閒明示為樂毅子，樂叔明示為孫，不補闕代父親；樂乘為樂閒宗不補兄弟。燕王喜來書及趙襄王君序各限本段，曹相國未見名字不回填。河上丈人至蓋公師承不作父子。依本篇明示姓名、君序與來書答書範圍暫接；燕惠王來書寡人指惠王、將軍指樂毅，樂毅答書先王指昭王、足下君王指惠王。伍子胥引古首吳王指闔閭，後吳王在夫差賜鴟夷後指夫差。父兄與群臣不補具體親屬，王齊為反間假說不作授王爵。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","text":"燕王恨不用樂閒，樂閒既在趙，乃遺樂閒書曰：「紂之時，箕子不用，犯諫不怠，以冀其聽；商容不達，身祇辱焉，以冀其變。及民志不入，獄囚自出，然後二子退隱。故紂負桀暴之累，二子不失忠聖之名。何者？其憂患之盡矣。今寡人雖愚，不若紂之暴也；燕民雖亂，不若殷民之甚也。室有語，不相盡，以告鄰里。二者，寡人不為君取也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004576","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004580","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004581","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"商容","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004582","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定後裔保留，不補未見姓名或直接父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004580","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004583","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-le